          <Pad Id="60IvkWB6bwGUfoMOIrk23l" Bounds="772,4308,415,389" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="COMMENTS&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The feature that sets VL apart from every other visual programming enviroment&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;We will be touching the entries Record and Class from the Node Browser, not the interface, not forward - rather advanced&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;It gets philosophical&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Objects are data types like Float, RGBA, Layer and have a custom name&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;A data type can join data and methods, similar to Vector (Join) and Vector (Split)&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;A data type is always a record or a class, with different features&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Can be created and destroyed dynamically while the patch is running&#xD;&#xA;Know about their properties individually and not from the outside">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
